### Code

```elixir
defmodule Parser do
  def parse(puzzle_input) do
    puzzle_input
    |> String.split("\n", trim: true)
    |> Enum.map(fn line ->
      [l, r] = line |> String.split() |> Enum.map(&String.to_integer/1)
      {l, r}
    end)
    |> Enum.unzip()
  end
end
```

