### Test Parser

```elixir
ExUnit.start(autorun: false)

defmodule ParserTest do
  use ExUnit.Case, async: true
  import Parser

  @input """
  1 6
  5 4
  3 2
  """

  @expected {[1, 5, 3], [6, 4, 2]}

  test "parse test" do
    actual = parse(@input)
    assert actual == @expected
  end
end

ExUnit.run()
```

