## Part One

### Code

```elixir
defmodule PartOne do
  def resolve(input) do
    IO.puts("--- Part One ---")
    IO.puts("Result: #{run(input)}")
  end

  def run(input) do
      input
      |> then(fn {left, right} ->
        sorted_left = Enum.sort(left)
        sorted_right = Enum.sort(right)
        Enum.zip(sorted_left, sorted_right)
      end)
      |> Enum.map(fn {l, r} -> abs(l - r) end)
      |> Enum.sum()
  end
end
```

