## Part Two

We now need to calculate how many times a number from teh left list appears in the right list.

<!-- livebook:{"break_markdown":true} -->

### Code

```elixir
defmodule PartTwo do
  def resolve(input) do
    IO.puts("--- Part Two ---")
    IO.puts("Result: #{run(input)}")
  end

  def run(input) do
    {left, right} = input

    right_counts = Enum.frequencies(right)
    
    left
    |> Enum.map(fn n ->
      case Map.get(right_counts, n) do
        nil -> 0
        count -> n * count
      end
    end)
    |> Enum.sum()
  end
end
```

